                     <div class="introductory-box text-center pb-4"><span class="title-decorative">Getting Started</span><h2 class="display-4">Begin Your Journey at CNCC</h2>
                        
                        <p class="lead-paragraph">Starting your college journey with Colorado Northwestern Community College begins
                           with these three steps.</p>
