                  </div>
               </div>
               <div class="row">
                  <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
                     
                     <div class="card white">
                        <div><img src="/images/Homepage/apply.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="Aplly to CNCC"></div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                           
                           <h3 class="card-title">Apply to CNCC</h3>
                           
                           <p class="card-text">You can apply to Colorado Northwestern in two simple steps. First, you will need to
                              create an account to receive updates and reminders. Second, log in to complete CNCC's
                              Online Application for Admissions. Both steps can be completed at the link below.</p>
                           
                           <h3 class="card-title"><a class="btn btn-default btn-highlight" title="Apply" href="https://cncc.elluciancrmrecruit.com/Apply/Account/Create">Apply</a><br><br></h3>
                           </div>
                     </div>
                     </div>
                  <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
                     
                     <div class="card bg-gray">
                        <div><img src="/images/Homepage/submit.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="Submiting Documents"></div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                           
                           <h3 class="card-title">Submit Documents</h3>
                           
                           <p class="card-text">Once accepted to Colorado Northwestern, there are still some steps to take before
                              you can enroll in classes. Our Admissions Office has built an online checklist to
                              help you complete and return all relevant documentation you need before you enroll<strong>.</strong></p>
                           
                           <h3 class="card-title"><a class="btn btn-default btn-highlight" title="Admissions Checklist" href="/admissions/admissions-checklist.php">Admissions Checklist</a><br><br></h3>
                           </div>
                     </div>
                     </div>
                  <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
                     
                     <div class="card white">
                        <div><img src="/images/Homepage/enroll.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="Enroll in Classes"></div>
                        <div class="card-body">
                           
                           <h3 class="card-title">Enroll in Classes</h3>
                           
                           <p class="card-text">After submitting all of your documentation and receiving your student identification
                              number (S-Number), you are ready to start the enrollment process. Be sure to meet
                              with your advisor prior to registering. They will help you select the appropriate
                              classes for your program.</p>
                           
                           <h3 class="card-title"><a class="btn btn-default btn-highlight" title="Enroll" href="https://cncc.navigate.eab.com/app/#/authentication/remote/">Enroll</a><br><br></h3>
                           </div>
