                              <div class="ac-textBlock">
                                 
                                 <p><span style="font-size: 18px;">This program prepares students for a professional career in medical imaging. Graduates
                                       gain hands-on experience through internships and are eligible to pursue national and/or
                                       state certification (as applicable). The Radiologic Technology program prepares students
                                       for employment opportunities in a variety of healthcare settings, helping meet local
                                       and national workforce needs.</span></p>
